| Parameter | Stored as | From |
|---------------------|----------|------------------------|
| `blocks.norm.γ` | `f64` | the default |
| `blocks.proj.w` | `bf16` | its own type, rounded once when the entry is given it (`params`) |
| `blocks.proj.b` | `f64` | the default |
| `final.γ` | `f32` | its own type, rounded once when the entry is given it (`params`) |

